==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*joottadak}}. Equivalent to {{suffix|fi|juoda|alt1=juo-|t1=to drink|ttaa|pos2={{fi-verb-aspect|curative}}}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{fi-pronunciation|*}}

===Verb===
{{fi-verb|cat=causative}}

# {{lb|fi|transitive}} to [[give]] as [[drink]] {{+obj|fi|all<to>}}
#: {{ux|fi|Näytelmässä Kleopatra '''juotti''' Caesarille myrkkyä.|In the play Cleopatra '''made''' Caesar '''drink''' poison.}}
#: {{ux|fi|'''Juotin''' lapselle vettä.|I '''gave''' the kid some water.}}
#: {{ux|fi|'''Juotin''' koiralle vettä.|I '''watered''' the dog.}}
# {{lb|fi|transitive}} to [[give]] a [[drink]] to; to [[water]] (an animal); to [[make]] someone drink, to be [[pushy]] in [[offer]]ing something to drink, (often) to get [[drunk]]
#: {{ux|fi|'''Juotin''' koiraa. / '''Juotin''' koiran.|I '''watered''' the dog.}}
#: {{ux|fi|Yritätkö '''juottaa''' minut humalaan?|Are you trying to '''get''' me drunk?}}
# {{lb|fi|transitive}} to use milk to [[fatten]], to [[feed]] young animals meant for [[slaughter]]
# {{lb|fi|transitive}} to [[solder]]

